// ============================================================================
// .gitignore — build artifacts, dependency and cache dirs never get pushed
// (mirrors the sibling @userfiction/inventory repo's .gitignore, with the
// demo/dist entry renamed to ui/dist for this package's UI folder)
// ============================================================================

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
dist/
ui/dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Tooling caches
.turbo/
.eslintcache
.vite/

# Package-manager logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent scratch space (see root AGENTS.md) - never commit. This package is its own
# git repo, so the root repo's `/Temp/` rule does not reach it: without this entry
# a probe file under Temp/ shows up as untracked dirt in `git status` here.
/Temp/
